{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">CAN-SET function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":1470,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/309013","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/CAN-SET-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/CAN-SET-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"CAN-SET-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">CAN-SET function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"CAN-SET-function__section_N10024_N10021_N10001\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Returns a logical value indicating whether\nyou can set a specified attribute for a specified widget.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"CAN-SET-function__syntax_GC15632680755\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d254011e96\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"CAN-SET-function__idGDF1X22662536\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>CAN-SET ( <var class=\"keyword varname\">handle</var> , <var class=\"keyword varname\">attribute-name</var> )</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">handle</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">An expression that evaluates to a handle. The handle must refer\nto a valid widget.</dd>\n        \n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">attribute-name</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">An expression that evaluates to a character-string value. The contents of the string\n            must be an attribute name. For more information on attributes, see the <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"Handle-Attributes-and-Methods-Reference.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/Handle-Attributes-and-Methods-Reference.html\">Handle Attributes and Methods Reference</a>.</dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"CAN-SET-function__notes_GC15642680766\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d254011e159\">Notes</h2>\n      \n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n        <li class=\"li\">For\na field-level widget, the CAN-SET function always returns TRUE for\nthe FRAME attribute; however, you can set the frame attribute only\nif the widget is dynamic. Therefore, before setting the FRAME attribute\nfor a widget, you can test that the operation is valid with a statement similar\nto the following:<table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"CAN-SET-function__idGDF1X32662543\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\"><tr class=\"row rowsep-0\"><td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\"><pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>IF CAN-SET(my-handle, &quot;FRAME&quot;) AND my-handle:DYNAMIC THEN\n  my-handle:FRAME = frame-handle.</code></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></li>\n        <li class=\"li\">For SpeedScript, use with buffer-field, buffer-object, buffer,\nand query-object handles.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"CAN-SET-function__see-also_GC15652680770\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d254011e182\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"CAN-QUERY-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/CAN-QUERY-function.html\">CAN-QUERY function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"LIST-QUERY-ATTRS-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/LIST-QUERY-ATTRS-function.html\">LIST-QUERY-ATTRS function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"LIST-SET-ATTRS-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/LIST-SET-ATTRS-function.html\">LIST-SET-ATTRS function</a></p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"CAN-QUERY-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/CAN-QUERY-function.html\">CAN-QUERY function</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"CAPS-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/CAPS-function.html\">CAPS function</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/309013","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":1318,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"CAN-SET function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/CAN-SET-function.html","type":"Manual"}